## 🚀 Installation

### 1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/multiagent-educational-chatbot.git
```

```bash
cd multiagent-educational-chatbot
```

### 2. Create a virtual environment

```bash
python -m venv venv
```

Activate it on Windows:

```bash
venv\Scripts\activate
```

On macOS/Linux:

```bash
source venv/bin/activate
```

### 3. Install dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Make sure the requirements include the packages actually used by the application, particularly:

```text
gradio
langgraph
langchain-groq
langchain-community
langchain-tavily
langchain-core
wikipedia
groq
```

---

## ▶️ Running the Application

After configuring the required API keys:

```bash
python app.py
```

The Gradio application will start and provide a web-based chatbot interface.

