## 🧠 Why Multi-Agent Architecture?

A traditional chatbot generally sends every question to the same prompt and model.

This project instead uses a **routing-based multi-agent architecture**.

```text
Single Agent Approach

User → One Agent → Response


Multi-Agent Approach

                 ┌→ Study Agent
User → Manager ──┼→ Coding Agent
                 └→ General Agent
```

This separation makes it easier to:

* Specialize agent behavior
* Customize prompts for different tasks
* Improve maintainability
* Add additional specialized agents
* Experiment with different models or parameters for different tasks

